<title>USA: Caldwell, N.J., sets May 6 for $6.6 mln bond vote.</title>
<headline>Caldwell, N.J., sets May 6 for $6.6 mln bond vote.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Caldwell School District, N.J., has set May 6 for a $6.6 million school general obligation bond referendum.</p>
<p>The bonds would be used to finance school renovations and technology improvements.</p>
<p>--Steven Dickson, 212-859-1652</p>
</text>
